sdc4:mc-ildygh9zrok9h3wxgqutovbe a sdc4-meta:ModelComponent ;
    rdfs:label "Act Lifecycle: active aborted states" ;
    rdfs:comment "States of the active aborted path of the Act Lifecycle workflow, in order: active, aborted. A transition is legal between adjacent states. The lifecycle of an act in the HL7 v3 Reference Information Model: preparatory (new, held), active, suspended, and the terminal states completed, cancelled, aborted, with nullified and obsolete outside the normal course. The generic clinical and administrative act state machine." ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml> ;
